{%- comment -%}
  fmx-note-photo (aaroma.co): Dutch / English / French note name -> FM note photo filename in Shopify Files
  (the same note_*.webp files magicperfume.co uses; copied by docs/note-photos/upload_files.py).
  Usage: {%- capture f -%}{%- render 'fmx-note-photo', name: note -%}{%- endcapture -%} -> "note_vanilla.webp" or empty.
  Generated by docs/note-photos/note_photo_map.py from the scent_notes titles (nl) and their fr translations;
  only true matches (no stand-in photos). Regenerate, don't hand-edit.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fmx_n = name | downcase | strip -%}
{%- case fmx_n -%}
  {%- when 'akigalahout', 'akigalawood' -%}note_akigalawood.webp
